sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant M as Model (rule)
    participant R as Risk gate
    participant Q as Maker
    participant B as Book
    participant L as Ledger / Bus
    M->>R: risk.allow(symbol, side, notional, equity, forecast...)
    R-->>M: (allowed, reason)
    alt allowed
        M->>Q: quote(symbol, side, notional)
        Q-->>M: (limit_price, fill_probability)
        M->>B: open(symbol, side, price, notional)
        B->>L: model.decision + model.fill
        L-->>B: fill_id + decision_id
    else rejected
        R-->>M: reason (stale / oversized / no capital)
    end
